Package: edukasaun-welcome
Version: 0.1.0
Section: education
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Edukasaun OS Maintainers <maintainers@edukasaun.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pyqt6, pkexec, ca-certificates, apt, systemd, tzdata
Recommends: lxqt-config, pcmanfm-qt, lxqt-policykit, flatpak, fonts-noto-core, fonts-noto-cjk
Homepage: https://www.edukasaunos.tl
Description: Welcome Screen for Edukasaun OS
 Six-page native Qt Welcome Screen shown after installation, before
 Eduka-Desktop starts: date, time and time zone (Asia/Dili first),
 Eduka-Desktop Suite overview, desktop customization,
 installed application detection, optional application installation,
 project information and community links.
